    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Fatigue at an improved baseline; no fever, night sweats, or weight loss</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Positive</td><td>Lightheaded on standing about twice a week; no syncope</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No back, hip, or joint pain or swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Word-finding difficulty only when tired</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood steady; PHQ-9 score 5 and GAD-7 score 4</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

